Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.38,0:00:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天起她就是你的媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,打声招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面，请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了吧，我去煮飯，一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不知合你的口味吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们第一次见面\N我和有小孩的男人結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒生过小孩,第—次当媽媽,我非常地不安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,來这都一个月了,刚开始很难聊起天來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我们开始能聊天了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,老公你在干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,制定明天的行程表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小武有好好上课吗?\N 有啦，是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.31,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,最近他开始跟我说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心哦,我还很担心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,明天会晚回來吗?\N也许会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会晚回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 \N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就在老公说会晚回的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小武，今天沒上课吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，打扫流了汗，所以我沖澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你怪怪的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽，早安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,別遮住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,裸体了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,別这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,別看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是母子就別遮住了\N    不要这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好美哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫你媽媽吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃媽媽的乳房
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你好怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不怪啊，为何跟爸結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.40,0:19:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛，別这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,突然跟我说有新媽媽，你知道我的心情吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的心情吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.33,0:19:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你來了之后我的肉棒就一直硬到現在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们沒血緣,可以做那种事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟你每天都和爸爸做爱一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个好点子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,做我的性奴隸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,教导小孩性教育是父母亲的责任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:21:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都和爸爸做爱，喜欢做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\N住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好美味\N哪里好吃?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要逃啊?\N 住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为何乳头硬了,舒服吧?\N我会让你更舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想舔你的小穴了\N 不要舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,手放下\N住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊\N給我听话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,听媽媽的话，舔小穴就好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿呢\N哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.45,0:25:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.49,0:25:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.38,0:26:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿呢\N住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.37,0:27:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.39,0:29:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.50,0:29:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.51,0:29:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.36,0:29:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴张开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.50,0:29:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.51,0:29:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好帮我口交，我就跟爸爸说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.51,0:30:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一下下就好\N住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.52,0:30:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一下下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.52,0:30:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.39,0:31:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的肉棒滋味怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.50,0:31:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.37,0:31:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,和爸爸的不一样吧,对,就这样舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.38,0:32:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊\N插一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.53,0:32:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.37,0:32:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.39,0:41:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.54,0:41:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.42,0:42:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的內射了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.40,0:42:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我把肉棒舔干净
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.55,0:42:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,舔干净
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.42,0:43:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.56,0:44:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,从那之后就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.40,0:44:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看光光了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.54,0:44:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,腿张开哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.55,0:44:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不听话我就上传网络哦\N   请別这样做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.56,0:44:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,腿张开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,手放下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.40,0:44:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,张开
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.54,0:44:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,张开点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.42,0:44:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,腿弄成M字那样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.43,0:45:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.43,0:45:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,別遮住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.44,0:45:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.56,0:45:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,每天我像是继子的性玩具\N就这样天天被他玩弄着
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.40,0:45:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一想到老公如果知道的话，我们就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.53,0:46:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.57,0:46:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,被发現就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.55,0:47:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,继续帮我舔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.55,0:47:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.57,0:47:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.41,0:47:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,继续口交
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.56,0:47:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,继续舔肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.46,0:49:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.57,0:49:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还沒射出呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小武起來了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.57,0:50:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,起來了\N不吃早餐吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.42,0:50:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你媽媽去哪了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.55,0:50:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她说肚子痛，在厕所吧也许
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.45,0:50:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还好沒被发現\N他进來会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.45,0:52:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,小武
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.58,0:52:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,來吃早賽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.42,0:52:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我进去囉，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.56,0:52:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽呢?沒在厕所吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.57,0:52:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有,奶油好像沒了,她去买了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.58,0:52:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦,对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.59,0:52:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.42,0:53:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你也快点吧,还好,赶得上巴士吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.57,0:53:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你快去上班吧\N 我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.57,0:53:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你別迟到了\N 不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.58,0:53:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一起出去吧\N我...   怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.59,0:53:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你先走吧\N你快点出來
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.57,0:53:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你兴奋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,差一点就被发現了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.58,0:53:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.59,0:54:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦，舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.44,0:54:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,用力吸
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.45,0:55:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.45,0:56:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过要吞下，吞下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.45,0:56:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的精液吞下去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.59,0:56:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你去送爸爸出门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.45,0:57:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好送他出门哦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.44,0:57:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我出门了，今会早回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.58,0:57:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.58,0:57:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.47,0:59:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.51,0:59:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,到底何时才能結束呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.59,0:59:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.46,1:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不好好服侍我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N你是人妻吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.61,1:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的結婚了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.45,1:00:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.59,1:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.59,1:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.60,1:00:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好好服侍我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.60,1:00:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了沒?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.49,1:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,沒办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.60,1:01:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸真可惡，竟然有欠債\N这也必需要还钱的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.45,1:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只能用你的身体賺钱还債了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.60,1:01:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.56,1:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,会变成这样真的很突然
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.47,1:02:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老公失踪了，还欠下债务\N我不得已只好在风俗店工作
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.60,1:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是啥店吗?是奴隸泡泡店耶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.47,1:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是付了很多钱的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.48,1:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你要好好服侍我哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.45,1:03:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，我真的做不到那样子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.46,1:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是奴隸泡泡店耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.47,1:03:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.58,1:03:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为何在这工作呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,算了，我既然付了钱\N你还是得做啊，太太
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.48,1:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.48,1:04:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,, 我真的做不到啊\N沒有做不到这种说法哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.49,1:04:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是付了很多钱的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.59,1:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.61,1:04:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.61,1:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,用舌头舔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.62,1:04:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.46,1:04:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉沒清洗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.47,1:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，钱还你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.61,1:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,换別人好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.62,1:05:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.62,1:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是付了很多钱的\N真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.46,1:05:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉有用吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是常客耶，我要告诉店长哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.61,1:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被开除的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.61,1:05:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,脫呵
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.63,1:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,脫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.60,1:05:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快脫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.47,1:06:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,脫掉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.54,1:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,过來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.62,1:07:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,过來啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.62,1:07:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.63,1:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,口交啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,握住
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.61,1:07:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.62,1:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我，放进嘴巴里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.48,1:08:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抽动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.62,1:08:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你第一次口交吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.62,1:08:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你常常帮老公口交的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.63,1:08:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.61,1:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.61,1:08:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你都无套的吧，想造小孩吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.62,1:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,用力吸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.49,1:09:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要这样弄啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.48,1:09:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.62,1:09:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,请住手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.49,1:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,才刚开始耶，舔我的睾丸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.50,1:09:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.61,1:09:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,用力吸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.48,1:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.62,1:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,舔肛门了哦\N这样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.63,1:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,別人都会舔的\N舔肛门了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.48,1:10:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,舔肛门
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.62,1:10:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头伸出來
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.62,1:11:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.63,1:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.63,1:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,味道怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.48,1:11:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.61,1:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛?\N抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.62,1:11:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.63,1:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请住手\N給我听话啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.64,1:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,給我听话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.48,1:11:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,过來
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.62,1:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,口交啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.62,1:12:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,口交啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.50,1:12:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.50,1:13:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何在这工作啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.64,1:13:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为喜欢做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.65,1:14:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是爱做爱的淫女吧\N   不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.63,1:14:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,用嘴吸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.64,1:14:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.64,1:14:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.65,1:14:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.63,1:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,用嘴吸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.50,1:15:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,射嘴里好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.64,1:15:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.49,1:15:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想射了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.65,1:16:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太太
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.49,1:16:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干净
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.63,1:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干净啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.65,1:16:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.66,1:16:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的精液好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.60,1:17:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊，我吃饱了，看着我说
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.64,1:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃饱了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.49,1:17:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能好好工作吗?\N刚才的客人抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.54,1:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直不肯听话\N 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.52,1:17:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我一开始就说了吧\N客人付你多少钱
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.60,1:18:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一、两万圆耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.64,1:18:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我只听说是高薪，沒听说是奴隸泡泡浴
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.65,1:18:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,奴隸泡泡浴也是啊\N客人叫做就做吖
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.50,1:18:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么我会变成这样呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.51,1:18:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的想做吗? 嗯\N下次再这样就开除你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.52,1:18:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.52,1:18:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这关系到本店的評價，你給我好好做啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.55,1:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛过來
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.50,1:19:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,脫掉衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.64,1:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.65,1:20:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,內裤也要吗?\N当然啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.53,1:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,沒用的奴隸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.51,1:20:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,冲水
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.65,1:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有帮老公洗过澡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.66,1:20:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,洗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.51,1:20:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我全身要弄泡泡啊\N     我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.65,1:21:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,想被开除吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.51,1:21:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,弄泡泡
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.51,1:22:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,今天请多指教
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.65,1:22:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.51,1:22:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才对
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.65,1:22:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己也要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.67,1:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么洗呢，用你的全身來洗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.51,1:23:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,跨坐上來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.65,1:23:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,用身体摩擦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.65,1:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.66,1:23:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.51,1:23:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,沒用的奴隸\N真的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.66,1:23:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,摩擦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.54,1:24:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,摩擦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.54,1:24:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.51,1:24:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头要摩擦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.54,1:24:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.64,1:25:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.68,1:25:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,插入了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.66,1:25:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗?\N对的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.52,1:26:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,洗肉棒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.66,1:26:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,弄泡泡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.67,1:26:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.54,1:26:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,洗肛门
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.68,1:26:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好好洗\N好的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.55,1:26:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为您洗肛门了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.53,1:27:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头伸出來
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.69,1:27:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,冲水吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.53,1:29:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我來洗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.67,1:29:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.68,1:29:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,舔舔看下有干净吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.68,1:30:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.69,1:30:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.53,1:30:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.67,1:30:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,舔看看有干净吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.56,1:31:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,用舌头舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.68,1:31:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有干净了吗?\N干净了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.69,1:31:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去准备下一个
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.53,1:31:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N好的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.67,1:32:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请吧\N好的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.68,1:32:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为您刷牙
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.69,1:32:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,沒用的奴隸
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.67,1:34:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱的太太哦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.56,1:35:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可以请您戴上保險套吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.70,1:35:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我付了很多钱耶，干嘛戴套啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.55,1:35:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?\N请稍等
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.55,1:35:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.69,1:36:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,让我舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.56,1:36:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,让我舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.57,1:36:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,抽动
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.55,1:36:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.69,1:37:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,舔啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.71,1:37:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.58,1:39:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.69,1:39:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头伸出來
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.70,1:39:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,百头伸出來
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.68,1:42:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么顫抖了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.72,1:42:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.72,1:42:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.58,1:43:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.72,1:43:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我口交啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.59,1:44:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,躺好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.72,1:45:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.73,1:45:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,客人要戴套啊\N奴隸是不需要戴套的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.57,1:45:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,戴套，这是奴隸泡泡店耶
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.59,1:46:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.73,1:46:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.58,1:47:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抽动
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.72,1:47:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.67,1:49:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,插入了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.64,1:51:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股翘高
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.61,1:55:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,  內射不行啊\N內射是基本的服务欸
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.60,1:55:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多哦
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.75,1:56:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.62,1:56:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多啦
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.62,1:56:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干净
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.76,1:56:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干净
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.76,1:56:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,吸干净
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.61,1:57:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.76,1:57:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间欸，在床上做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.77,1:57:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我再射更多給你
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.74,1:57:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.69,1:58:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.76,1:58:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,托你的福，我要工作了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.64,1:58:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,今后为了我,请好好工作哦
